e County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 50% of normal in September to October and 164% in May to June. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 264% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 12765 had its driest year in 1954, at 56% of normal.</p>"}
